    "text": "<p>Let the functions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Then, the number of points in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is NOT differentiable is equal to :</p>",
