    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp; (Discontinuous)</p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp; (continuous)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is differentiable for all&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p>",
